        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "OPEN VIEWING SATURDAY 3RD OF OCTOBER 11AM TO 11:30AM\nNo. 160 Gleann Dara is a top class 3 bedroom residence in excellent condition. Brilliantly located close to the university, hospital, schools, church, shopping centre, and is within easy reach of the city centre and Salthill. \n\nTop class decorative condition, built in units in bedrooms, downstairs WC, fabulous garden to rear. Excellent off street parking, OFCH, double glazed. Very suitable for owner occupier or anyone looking to reside close to the university or hospital.\n\nComprising: sitting room, kitchen/ dining room, downstairs WC and WHB, 3 excellent bedrooms with built in units, main bathroom WC and WHB. A lovely home in excellent condition. Viewing highly recommended.\n\nDetails with John Quinn. 091 569 174. \n"
